## Key Decisions

- Physics uses flat arrays (not ECS) for simplicity in early phase
- SAP only sweeps X-axis for broadphase (Y/Z axes deferred)
- GJK/EPA deferred to later in P3; basic sphere/sphere SAT kept as fallback
- CI targets ubuntu-latest, windows-latest, macos-latest with GCC/Clang/MSVC
- Code is original implementation, no third-party code copied

## Build

```bash
cmake -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
cmake --build build -j2

# Test
ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure
```

## Known Issues

- P4 Script VM call/return mechanism has bugs
- Function calls return incorrect values (-1.0 instead of expected results)
- Bytecode generation is correct but VM execution has issues
- Full test suite may hang, needs investigation
